WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:04,100
To save my life, just put a ring on your mouth.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,300
The benefactor is right

3
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,100
I should repay you for saving my life.

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,300
Benefactor, what do you want?

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,300
Since you said you should act like a cow or a horse

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,100
Then from today on, you are my beast

7
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,120
Become a cow or a horse

8
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,720
Literally acting like a cow and a horse

9
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:18,720
I didn’t let you do it for nothing

10
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,520
Help you with three meals a day and help you with housing

11
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,720
Help you with your wedding gift and help your child live for a long time

12
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,720
Can be stored in 100g portions per month

13
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,320
But I have already joined the K1 base

14
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,920
That base has no future

15
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:29,320
You have to talk to a promising base

16
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,120
For example, we are left with the base

17
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:35,330
The base is left. You are the one who has the base left. I know it.

18
00:00:35,330 --> 00:00:37,130
You are the good female captain they say

19
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,530
Get them out of the city in the front yard

20
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:39,530
And send it away unconditionally

21
00:00:39,530 --> 00:00:41,330
You are a good person and I would like to join you.

22
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:44,970
Okay, captain, you will also move along.

23
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:45,970
I thought someone would save me

24
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:46,970
And you seem to be much better than me
